{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "cap-title",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1500,
   "y": -420,
   "width": 1500,
   "height": 170,
   "text": "# LLaDA2.2-mini — one layer (L1–L19)  \nPre-norm block: **bidirectional GQA attention** then a **block-routed MoE**. Shapes per forward pass, T = tokens fed (multiple of 32). L0 is identical except its FFN is one dense SwiGLU 2048 → 5120 → 2048 (31.5M)."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-legend",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 60,
   "y": -420,
   "width": 1400,
   "height": 170,
   "text": "Layer parameters: attention 10.5M · router 0.5M · shared expert 3.1M · 256 routed experts 805.3M.    \nFrom `LLaDA2MoeAttention`, `LLaDA2MoeGate.block_routing` and `LLaDA2MoeSparseMoeBlock` in modeling_llada2_moe.py; shapes from the checkpoint."
  },
  {
   "id": "xin1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -82,
   "y": -180,
   "width": 164,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 170,
   "y": -190,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`x [T, 2048]  (residual stream)`"
  },
  {
   "id": "n13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -150,
   "y": -131,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**RMSNorm** (input_layernorm)",
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "qkv4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -150,
   "y": -35,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**query_key_value** 2048 → 3072  \n6.3M · no bias",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "qkvt5",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -123,
   "y": 61,
   "width": 246,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl6",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 170,
   "y": 31,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`qkv [T, 16+4+4 heads, 128]`"
  },
  {
   "id": "qn7",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1050,
   "y": 190,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**Q** 16 heads · RMSNorm per head",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "qr8",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1050,
   "y": 286,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 66,
   "text": "**RoPE** on 64 of 128 dims    \nθ = 3,000,000",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
