   "text": "`x [T, 2048]  → next layer`"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-route",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 680,
   "y": 2051,
   "width": 700,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**Block routing** (new in LLaDA2.2): all 32 tokens of a block may only use the same 48 experts, so a block's MoE touches ≤ 48 of 256 expert weight sets. config.json also lists `n_group` / `topk_group`, but this modeling code does not use them."
  }
